WEBVTT

50:00.322 --> 50:04.367
What is it, Mom?
Mom, where are you?

50:04.451 --> 50:06.952
Buzz. Hey.
Buzz, are you okay?

50:07.037 --> 50:10.206
Gone! It's all gone.

50:10.290 --> 50:13.167
All of it's gone.
Bye-bye. See ya.

50:13.251 --> 50:14.293
What happened to you?

50:14.378 --> 50:17.046
One minute you're defending
the whole galaxy.

50:17.130 --> 50:21.092
And suddenly you find yourself
suckin' down Darfeeling with

50:21.176 --> 50:24.345
Marie Antoinette
and her little sister.

50:26.264 --> 50:28.557
I think you've had
enough tea for today.

50:28.642 --> 50:30.393
Let's get you outta here, Buzz.
